Package: libcurl4
Version: @DEB_CURL_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://curl.se/
Depends: libnghttp2-14, libidn2-0, libpsl5, libssl3, libzstd1, libbrotli1
Replaces: curl (<< @DEB_CURL_V@)
Conflicts: curl (<< @DEB_CURL_V@)
Description: client-side URL transfer library
 libcurl is a client-side URL transfer library. This lean OpenSSL build includes
 HTTP/2, IDN, PSL, Brotli, and zstd support while omitting SSH, RTMP, c-ares,
 and HTTP/3 backends.
